  "notes": "This preset cleans Definitive Healthcare contact lists (NURSES_250_HOSP_ONLY.csv format) by standardizing customer identifiers, deduplicating by location while keeping highest-authority contacts, and applying smart address matching to catch semantic duplicates. Expected significant row reduction due to keeping only best contact per facility."
